  "section": "6.146",
  "rulesText": "A saddle comes with a bit, a bridle, reins, and any other equipment needed to use the saddle. A Military Saddle gives Advantage on any ability check you make to remain mounted. An Exotic Saddle is required for riding an aquatic or a flying mount.\n\nMounts and Other Animals\n\nTack, Harness, and Drawn Vehicles",
